 ## Dev Note
 
 Pre-launch CDN and capacity decisions are tracked in the [Desktop update proposal](../../.agents/notes/proposed/feature/2026-09-08-desktop-update-policy-and-installation.md#cdn-and-capacity-qualification).
+
+OmicOS OSS derivative: the application identity, welcome artwork and copy use OmicOS; the welcome entry opens the local workspace without credentials. DeepSeek account/API-key operations remain provider-specific. Product locale IDs preserve explicit English/Chinese preferences in the native shell.
